  "notes": "Issue #449. EXP-374's exact feature set (stop-notation-invariant v2 parser, Ensembl release 116 isoform residue mask, pathway families, hotspot-34) is held fixed via build_fold_features() reused directly from scripts/run_exp374_stop_isoform_residue_mask.py. The sole change is the model: LightGBM with EXP-209's fixed hyperparameters (no retuning, no Optuna -- time-constrained, and EXP-285's tuning did not transfer to Public). Supersedes #342 (stalled, targeted the pre-parser-fix EXP-334 lineage). Target, test distribution and Public LB do not define the feature set or hyperparameters."
